    {
      "id": "76e6e315e5c1",
      "source": "Toggle Light / Dark / Auto color theme",
      "target": "切换浅色/深色/自动颜色主题",
      "note": "translation memory"
    },
    {
      "id": "1c7a937238b8",
      "source": "Toggle table of contents sidebar",
      "target": "切换目录侧边栏",
      "note": "translation memory"
    },
    {
      "id": "b9e4853f12bb",
      "source": "Color",
      "target": "颜色",
      "note": "translation memory"
    },
    {
      "id": "551dac0f62fc",
      "source": "Color is a category of nodes outputting color values.",
      "target": "Color 是一类输出颜色值的节点。",
      "note": "stage 3B translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "a2313ca6ec1f",
      "source": " Color Nodes",
      "target": " Color Nodes（颜色节点）",
      "note": "stage 3B translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "7d12d32d5da5",
      "source": " Color: Constant",
      "target": " Color: Constant（常量颜色）",
      "note": "stage 3B translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "655694d47423",
      "source": "Outputs a single color value.",
      "target": "输出单个颜色值。",
      "note": "stage 3B translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "3f0d4465e01c",
      "source": "You can ",
      "target": "你可以 ",
      "note": "stage 3B translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "79475bcf74eb",
      "source": " click on the colored square to open the Color Picker.",
      "target": " 单击彩色方块以打开 Color Picker。",
      "note": "stage 3B translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "9d210f43bd1d",
      "source": "Color Picker",
      "target": "Color Picker（颜色选择器）",
      "note": "stage 3B translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "f78e76c44b6a",
      "source": " Color picker. Hold ",
      "target": " Color picker（取色器）。按住 ",
      "note": "stage 3B translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "60f41139bef3",
      "source": " and drag to select a color anywhere on the screen. This will select colors even from outside the application!",
      "target": " 并拖动，可从屏幕任意位置选择颜色。这样甚至可以选择应用程序外部的颜色。",
      "note": "stage 3B translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "1e8393e3a2b4",
      "source": " Resets the color to the default for that parameter.",
      "target": " 将颜色重置为该参数的默认值。",
      "note": "stage 3B translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "64e6b81e4f9b",
      "source": " Closes the color picker. The color will remain at whatever is selected in the color picker. You can also click outside of the color picker to close it.",
      "target": " 关闭颜色选择器。颜色会保持为颜色选择器中当前选中的颜色。你也可以点击颜色选择器外部来关闭它。",
      "note": "stage 3B translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "d5c47f29b59f",
      "source": "Hue ring. Visualizes all the hues. The selected hue is indicated with a circle ",
      "target": "Hue ring（色相环）。显示所有色相。选中的色相会用圆圈 ",
      "note": "stage 3B translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "ea60204ebdd6",
      "source": " You can ",
      "target": " 你可以 ",
      "note": "stage 3B translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "dda03d4b4969",
      "source": " click or click and drag anywhere on the circle to select a hue.",
      "target": " 在圆环上的任意位置单击或点击拖动以选择色相。",
      "note": "stage 3B translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "332a9bac3a4e",
      "source": "Brightness and saturation triangle. The three corners represent white, black, and a fully saturated color. The selected value is indicated with a circle ",
      "target": "Brightness and saturation triangle（亮度与饱和度三角）。三个角分别表示白色、黑色和完全饱和的颜色。选中的值会用圆圈 ",
      "note": "stage 3B translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "ba9202ab1bd6",
      "source": " You can ",
      "target": " 你可以 ",
      "note": "stage 3B translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "4cc792626b2d",
      "source": " click or click and drag anywhere on the triangle to select a color.",
      "target": " 在三角形上的任意位置单击或点击拖动以选择颜色。",
      "note": "stage 3B translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "50d28f974f14",
      "source": "Current Color",
      "target": "Current Color（当前颜色）",
      "note": "stage 3B translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "8a72be6f0a21",
      "source": "HEX code. Here, you can type in a hexadecimal code to get a specific color by ",
      "target": "HEX code（HEX 代码）。你可以在这里输入十六进制代码来获得指定颜色，方法是 ",
      "note": "stage 3B translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "803e36e5b0a5",
      "source": " clicking in the text field.",
      "target": " 点击文本字段。",
      "note": "stage 3B translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "e46e06873747",
      "source": "RGB Mode. This will set the sliders to represent the color in Red, Green, and Blue values. All mapped from 0 to 255.",
      "target": "RGB Mode（RGB 模式）。这会让滑块以 Red（红）、Green（绿）、Blue（蓝）数值表示颜色，全部映射到 0 到 255。",
      "note": "stage 3B translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "fa289d6cd5f2",
      "source": "HSV Mode. This will set the sliders to represent the color in Hue, Saturation, and Value. ",
      "target": "HSV Mode（HSV 模式）。这会让滑块以 Hue（色相）、Saturation（饱和度）、Value（明度）表示颜色。",
      "note": "stage 3B translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "444e8d3623a9",
      "source": "Hue",
      "target": "Hue",
      "note": "stage 3B translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "6543832d349d",
      "source": " is mapped circular from 0 to 360 degrees starting and ending with red, using this slider you can see the circle in the Hue ring turning. Saturation and Value are mapped from 0% to 100% ,saturation from grayscale to fully saturated and value from black to whatever is the brightest color based on the hue and saturation.",
      "target": " 会从 0 到 360 度以环形方式映射，起点和终点都是红色；使用这个滑块时，可以看到色相环中的圆圈在转动。Saturation（饱和度）和 Value（明度）映射为 0% 到 100%；Saturation 从灰度映射到完全饱和，Value 从黑色映射到基于当前色相和饱和度的最亮颜色。",
      "note": "stage 3B translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "506e07281b23",
      "source": "Channel Values. These represent the numerical value of the slider next to it. ",
      "target": "Channel Values（通道值）。这些值表示旁边滑块的数值。",
      "note": "stage 3B translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "afb572a15898",
      "source": " click within the text box to type in a value manually.",
      "target": " 在文本框内单击即可手动输入数值。",
      "note": "stage 3B translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "359eb04bb555",
      "source": "Channel Sliders. These sliders can be used to change the color. The gradients on the sliders represent what the selected color would be if the indicator ",
      "target": "Channel Sliders（通道滑块）。这些滑块可用于修改颜色。滑块上的渐变表示如果指示器 ",
      "note": "stage 3B translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "84c0c936c158",
      "source": " was placed on that position. You can ",
      "target": " 位于该位置时选中颜色会是什么样。你可以 ",
      "note": "stage 3B translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "61fcabd215a8",
      "source": " click or click and drag anywhere on the slider to select a color.",
      "target": " 在滑块上的任意位置单击或点击拖动以选择颜色。",
      "note": "stage 3B translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "1ba50bd7159d",
      "source": "Swatch Dropdown.",
      "target": "Swatch Dropdown（色板下拉菜单）。",
      "note": "stage 3B translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "3508773fc250",
      "source": "Saved Colors",
      "target": "Saved Colors（已保存颜色）",
      "note": "stage 3B translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "2747916c9c7e",
      "source": " Holds a palette of saved colors ",
      "target": " 包含已保存颜色的色板 ",
      "note": "stage 3B translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "06b84e871e6c",
      "source": " You can save the selected color using the ",
      "target": " 可以使用 ",
      "note": "stage 3B translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "ad35813a4fdc",
      "source": " icon ",
      "target": " 图标 ",
      "note": "stage 3B translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "8e7fe8fb4546",
      "source": ". You can remove a saved color by ",
      "target": "，用于保存所选颜色。也可以通过 ",
      "note": "stage 3B audit spacing fix"
    },
    {
      "id": "2dec0c2d20d4",
      "source": " clicking on one and selecting ",
      "target": " 右键单击其中一个并选择 ",
      "note": "stage 3B translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "b9b78f75bcf7",
      "source": "Remove",
      "target": "Remove",
      "note": "stage 3B translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "1f28267335a2",
      "source": "Recent Colors",
      "target": "Recent Colors（最近颜色）",
      "note": "stage 3B translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "2959889630f5",
      "source": " Holds a palette of the last 9 colors used. When the color picker is closed, the selected color will be stored as the most recent color all the way to the right in the Recent Colors palette moving all the other colors one spot to the left and discarting the first one on the left.",
      "target": " 包含最近使用的 9 种颜色。关闭颜色选择器时，所选颜色会存为 Recent Colors 色板最右侧的最新颜色，其他颜色会依次向左移动一位，最左侧的颜色会被丢弃。",
      "note": "stage 3B translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "5c0a8fdf0344",
      "source": " Color: Gradient",
      "target": " Color: Gradient（颜色渐变）",
      "note": "stage 3B translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "1a18548a7fc2",
      "source": "Interpolation Color Space:",
      "target": "Interpolation Color Space（插值颜色空间）：",
      "note": "stage 3B translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "487f802b65e7",
      "source": " A dropdown menu with different methods of interpolating color from one point in the color gradient to another.",
      "target": " 一个下拉菜单，包含在颜色渐变中从一个点到另一个点插值颜色的不同方法。",
      "note": "stage 3B translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "f33f3c763d61",
      "source": "\n            Sorry, your browser doesn't support embedded videos.\n        ",
      "target": "\n            抱歉，你的浏览器不支持嵌入式视频。\n        ",
      "note": "translation memory"
    },
    {
      "id": "d023b60f8f5f",
      "source": "Color Gradient:",
      "target": "Color Gradient:",
      "note": "stage 3B translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "a86da4899049",
      "source": " Creates a range of colors.",
      "target": " 创建一段颜色范围。",
      "note": "stage 3B translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "02cc45e52fed",
      "source": "Add a point by ",
      "target": "通过 ",
      "note": "stage 3B translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "d7506fa974a8",
      "source": " clicking on the gradient.",
      "target": " 点击渐变来添加点。",
      "note": "stage 3B translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "7f956154544b",
      "source": "Move a point holding ",
      "target": "按住 ",
      "note": "stage 3B translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "6bedf7874e8b",
      "source": " and dragging.",
