    },
    {
      "id": "da9e439ba3c3",
      "source": ".png",
      "target": ".png",
      "note": "stage 3B translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "6c6c6bd24296",
      "source": " file in a desired location. This file format can be loaded into most software and used as, for example, a color input for another volume shader. The image resolution is 512 by 12 pixels meaning 512 different colors could be stored.",
      "target": " 文件到指定位置。此文件格式可加载到大多数软件中，例如作为另一个体积着色器的颜色输入。图像分辨率为 512 x 12 像素，意味着可以存储 512 种不同颜色。",
      "note": "stage 3B translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "30242395c0bf",
      "source": "\n            Sorry, your browser doesn't support embedded videos.\n        ",
