    },
    {
      "id": "636d3613e626",
      "source": " Color Selector",
      "target": " Color Selector（颜色选择器节点）",
      "note": "stage 3B translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "ff5d28927fda",
      "source": "Outputs a single color from a ",
      "target": "基于渐变上的指定位置，从 ",
      "note": "stage 3B translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "fc34ff1ec5c7",
      "source": "Color Gradient",
      "target": "Color Gradient",
      "note": "stage 3B translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "57526aef80f8",
      "source": " node based on a specified position on the gradient.",
      "target": " 节点输出单个颜色。",
      "note": "stage 3B translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "ba01fb4d3bc4",
      "source": "Connecting Color Nodes",
      "target": "连接颜色节点",
      "note": "stage 3B translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "baf0a3304033",
      "source": "Color nodes can be connected to color parameters.",
      "target": "颜色节点可以连接到颜色参数。",
      "note": "stage 3B translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "c23eeb8587ac",
      "source": "The color of this parameter will then be controlled in the color node.",
      "target": "该参数的颜色随后会由颜色节点控制。",
      "note": "stage 3B translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "9b1c7739fa1d",
      "source": "A color parameter is recognized by the colored square next to it.",
      "target": "颜色参数可以通过其旁边的彩色方块来识别。",
      "note": "stage 3B translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "1b19a461c624",
      "source": "The following are some examples of parameters that can be controlled by color nodes:",
      "target": "以下是一些可由颜色节点控制的参数示例：",
      "note": "stage 3B translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "cfa67e656033",
      "source": "To expose a color parameter pin for connecting a color node",
      "target": "若要公开用于连接颜色节点的颜色参数引脚，",
      "note": "stage 3B translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "5f7f25e550ff",
      "source": "you have to set the override state to ",
      "target": "需要将覆盖状态设置为 ",
      "note": "stage 3B translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "af0fb6f43da3",
      "source": "Pin Override",
      "target": "Pin Override",
      "note": "stage 3B translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "b9c396a91d1b",
      "source": " by ",
      "target": "，通过 ",
      "note": "stage 3B short-fragment fix"
    },
    {
      "id": "67764968a174",
      "source": " clicking the icon next to the parameter.",
      "target": " 点击参数旁边的图标。",
      "note": "stage 3B audit fix"
    },
    {
      "id": "01db212138c8",
      "source": "The ",
      "target": "其中 ",
      "note": "stage 3B context translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "dbad045622e3",
      "source": "Smoke color",
      "target": "Smoke color",
      "note": "stage 3B translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "3a0665579f55",
      "source": " and the ",
      "target": " 和 ",
      "note": "stage 3B translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "351057cd9e16",
      "source": "Fire color",
      "target": "Fire color",
      "note": "stage 3B translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "185dcd4d3b97",
      "source": " are different.",
      "target": " 不同。",
      "note": "stage 3B translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "32c4dc1c41cd",
      "source": "Exposing the color parameter pin for these parameters works differently since it’s done by setting the dropdown menu above to ",
      "target": "这些参数公开颜色参数引脚的方式不同，因为需要将上方的下拉菜单设置为 ",
      "note": "stage 3B translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "1698d0fc9115",
      "source": "Exposed Color Gradient",
      "target": "Exposed Color Gradient",
      "note": "stage 3B translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "e5bfe4f63ddf",
      "source": "These parameters should be connected to a ",
      "target": "这些参数应连接到 ",
      "note": "stage 3B translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "556ac2478e1c",
      "source": "Color Gradient",
      "target": "Color Gradient",
      "note": "stage 3B translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "9e6a193f48fa",
      "source": " node.",
      "target": " 节点。",
      "note": "stage 3B translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "f0fe7a6c1739",
      "source": "The right side of the gradient represents the highest values for the smoke or fire and the left side the lowest values.",
      "target": "渐变右侧表示烟或火的最高值，左侧表示最低值。",
      "note": "stage 3B translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "f46e948375a5",
      "source": "You can adjust the range in which the values are mapped to the gradient using the ",
      "target": "可以使用着色节点中的 ",
      "note": "stage 3B translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "6682ef6f344f",
      "source": "Coloring remap range",
      "target": "Coloring remap range",
      "note": "stage 3B translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "f34e28a3101c",
      "source": " parameter in the shading node.\nThe histogram above it shows in what range the voxel densities live. To get a good mapping you usually start by fitting the range (black area) around the white bars by adjusting the max value.",
      "target": " 参数调整数值映射到渐变的范围。\n其上方的直方图显示体素密度所在的范围。为了得到良好的映射，通常先调整最大值，让范围（黑色区域）包住白色条形。",
      "note": "stage 3B translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "730ad4594e1e",
      "source": "You can change the interpolation of the range with a gamma operation using the ",
      "target": "可以使用 ",
      "note": "stage 3B translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "81972b561f6e",
      "source": "Coloring remap ramp",
      "target": "Coloring remap ramp",
      "note": "stage 3B translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "c443dee68644",
      "source": " parameter. Lower values will push the color more towards the right side of the inputted color gradient, and higher values will push the color more towards the left side of the color gradient.",
      "target": " 参数，通过 gamma 运算改变该范围的插值方式。较低的值会把颜色推向输入颜色渐变的右侧，较高的值会把颜色推向渐变的左侧。",
      "note": "stage 3B translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "496e3344d327",
      "source": "A color parameter can also have two squares next to it as with the ",
      "target": "颜色参数旁边也可能有两个方块，例如 ",
      "note": "stage 3B translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "1bfdbd61ff4f",
      "source": "Color: Constant",
      "target": "Color: Constant",
      "note": "stage 3B translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "4470a5ad84af",
      "source": " node. This means that the parameter also supports an alpha channel.",
      "target": " 节点就是如此。这表示该参数也支持 Alpha 通道。",
      "note": "stage 3B translation"
